\Omega_0^2\frac{\delta + \alpha R_0^2/r^2}{\delta + \alpha R^2/r^2} \;&=\;\; \left(\frac{L/mr^2 + cy/r^2}{\delta + \alpha R^2/r^2}\right)^2, \tag{62}\\
